  "title": "Chinese Pork Tenderloin",
  "description": "The Chinese pork tenderloin marinade is delicious and easy to prepare. It includes easy-to-find hoisin sauce, black bean sauce, and fresh ginger.",
  "authors": [
    "JENNIFER72_00"
  ],
